            'Lineweaver-Burk Double-Reciprocal Linearization: 1/v = (Km / Vmax) * (1/[S]) + (1 / Vmax); Plotted as 1/v vs 1/[S]; Slope equals Km/Vmax; Y-intercept equals 1/Vmax; X-intercept equals -1/Km.',
